            Where is your archive?                                                                  
            Pick the folder that holds your Git repos. ChitraGit keeps its records in a             
            .chitragit folder inside it, so the archive stays portable. Nothing in your             
            repos is changed.                                                                       
                                                                                                    
            Folder: /home/dev/repos▌                                                                
                                                                                                    
